          "texts_in_order": [
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "text": "What services does Carpio Media provide? Carpio Media provides real estate photography, cinematic listing videos, drone photography, drone video, FPV fly-throughs, agent-branding content, commercial video, event coverage, editing, color grading, vertical social content, and horizontal video."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h4",
              "text": "What services does Carpio Media provide?"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Carpio Media provides real estate photography, cinematic listing videos, drone photography, drone video, FPV fly-throughs, agent-branding content, commercial video, event coverage, editing, color grading, vertical social content, and horizontal video."
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "text": "Are you FAA certified and insured? Yes. Carpio Media is operated by an FAA Part 107 certified drone pilot with more than 9,000 flight hours and a former airline captain background. The company is licensed and insured. Proof of insurance is available upon request."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h4",
              "text": "Are you FAA certified and insured?"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Yes. Carpio Media is operated by an FAA Part 107 certified drone pilot with more than 9,000 flight hours and a former airline captain background. The company is licensed and insured. Proof of insurance is available upon request."
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "text": "Can you fly at my property? Every project starts with an FAA airspace review, flight planning, and a safety assessment. The location, weather, timing, site conditions, and any restrictions are reviewed before we confirm the best approach."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h4",
              "text": "Can you fly at my property?"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Every project starts with an FAA airspace review, flight planning, and a safety assessment. The location, weather, timing, site conditions, and any restrictions are reviewed before we confirm the best approach."
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "text": "How far in advance should I book? Three to seven days is ideal. Same-day and next-day projects are often possible depending on schedule, weather, location, and airspace requirements. Share the property address, services needed, deliverables, and desired date for an accurate quote."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h4",
              "text": "How far in advance should I book?"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Three to seven days is ideal. Same-day and next-day projects are often possible depending on schedule, weather, location, and airspace requirements. Share the property address, services needed, deliverables, and desired date for an accurate quote."
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "text": "Do you create FPV drone tours and indoor fly-throughs? Yes. FPV fly-throughs create dynamic movement through properties, venues, retail spaces, and outdoor locations. Each flight path is planned around the story, layout, obstacles, people, lighting, and safe operating conditions."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h4",
              "text": "Do you create FPV drone tours and indoor fly-throughs?"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Yes. FPV fly-throughs create dynamic movement through properties, venues, retail spaces, and outdoor locations. Each flight path is planned around the story, layout, obstacles, people, lighting, and safe operating conditions."
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "text": "Where does Carpio Media work? Carpio Media is based in Forest Hills, Queens and regularly serves Manhattan, Brooklyn, the Bronx, Staten Island, Long Island, Westchester, Northern New Jersey, and Connecticut. Travel beyond these areas can be discussed for the right project."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h4",
              "text": "Where does Carpio Media work?"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Carpio Media is based in Forest Hills, Queens and regularly serves Manhattan, Brooklyn, the Bronx, Staten Island, Long Island, Westchester, Northern New Jersey, and Connecticut. Travel beyond these areas can be discussed for the right project."
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "text": "What happens if weather or airspace makes a flight unsafe? Safety comes first. Weather, FAA restrictions, temporary flight restrictions, stadium restrictions, emergency operations, crowd safety, and site conditions can affect a flight. If conditions are not right, we coordinate the best next step."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h4",
              "text": "What happens if weather or airspace makes a flight unsafe?"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Safety comes first. Weather, FAA restrictions, temporary flight restrictions, stadium restrictions, emergency operations, crowd safety, and site conditions can affect a flight. If conditions are not right, we coordinate the best next step."
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "text": "Why does Carpio Media specialize in real estate? A property has to earn attention quickly, communicate value clearly, and make people want to see more. By focusing on real estate media, Carpio Media can plan more efficiently, work with more consistency, and create stronger results for agents, brokerages, developers, property managers, architects, interior designers, and owners."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h4",
              "text": "Why does Carpio Media specialize in real estate?"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "A property has to earn attention quickly, communicate value clearly, and make people want to see more. By focusing on real estate media, Carpio Media can plan more efficiently, work with more consistency, and create stronger results for agents, brokerages, developers, property managers, architects, interior designers, and owners."
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "text": "Can you photograph the interior and exterior of a property too? Yes. We can combine aerial coverage with interior photography, exterior photography, listing video, walkthroughs, and social content so the campaign feels complete and consistent."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h4",
              "text": "Can you photograph the interior and exterior of a property too?"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Yes. We can combine aerial coverage with interior photography, exterior photography, listing video, walkthroughs, and social content so the campaign feels complete and consistent."
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "text": "Can you make Instagram Reels and both vertical and horizontal video? Yes. Deliverables can include vertical social versions, horizontal video, short promotional edits, drone footage, FPV footage, and high resolution photography. We plan the formats around where the work will be seen."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h4",
              "text": "Can you make Instagram Reels and both vertical and horizontal video?"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Yes. Deliverables can include vertical social versions, horizontal video, short promotional edits, drone footage, FPV footage, and high resolution photography. We plan the formats around where the work will be seen."
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "text": "What information do you need before providing a quote? Send the property address or project location, project type, services needed, intended deliverables, desired delivery date, whether the property is occupied, and any special requests. We will review the real scope and provide an accurate quote."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h4",
              "text": "What information do you need before providing a quote?"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Send the property address or project location, project type, services needed, intended deliverables, desired delivery date, whether the property is occupied, and any special requests. We will review the real scope and provide an accurate quote."
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "text": "How long does a shoot take? Timing depends on property size, services selected, weather, location, access, preparation, and deliverables. Once we review the project details, we provide a realistic production plan and schedule."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h4",
              "text": "How long does a shoot take?"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Timing depends on property size, services selected, weather, location, access, preparation, and deliverables. Once we review the project details, we provide a realistic production plan and schedule."
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "text": "How quickly will I receive my files? Delivery timing is confirmed with the project quote because it depends on scope and deliverables. Finished files are delivered through an online link, and minor revisions are included so the work matches the agreed direction."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h4",
              "text": "How quickly will I receive my files?"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Delivery timing is confirmed with the project quote because it depends on scope and deliverables. Finished files are delivered through an online link, and minor revisions are included so the work matches the agreed direction."
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "text": "Do I need to be at the property during the shoot? Not always. Access and site readiness matter most. If the property is prepared and access is arranged, Carpio Media can handle the production independently while keeping you informed."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h4",
              "text": "Do I need to be at the property during the shoot?"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Not always. Access and site readiness matter most. If the property is prepared and access is arranged, Carpio Media can handle the production independently while keeping you informed."
            },
            {
              "tag": "li",
              "text": "Do you offer recurring work for agents, brokerages, and property teams? Yes. Carpio Media works with clients who need consistent listing coverage, agent branding, construction updates, commercial media, and ongoing production support. Share your needs when requesting a quote so the workflow can be planned around your schedule."
            },
            {
              "tag": "h4",
              "text": "Do you offer recurring work for agents, brokerages, and property teams?"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Yes. Carpio Media works with clients who need consistent listing coverage, agent branding, construction updates, commercial media, and ongoing production support. Share your needs when requesting a quote so the workflow can be planned around your schedule."
            }
          ],
